(5100979, 744421, 60614, '<td valign="top">Looks like a wonderful place to go hiking.  I just love oaks.  Your photo has a nice warm glow.  This one looks like it would be a great candidate for tonemapping and/or HDR to bring the detail out in the tree trucks to make it pop.  I have never done it myself but hope to learn some day.  I am sure some will probably say the photo too busy but that is one of the things I like about it.  Nature is Nature.  Hope it does well.</td>', 'Looks like a wonderful place to go hiking.  I just love oaks.  Your photo has a nice warm glow.  This one looks like it would be a great candidate for tonemapping and/or HDR to bring the detail out in the tree trucks to make it pop.  I have never done it myself but hope to learn some day.  I am sure some will probably say the photo too busy but that is one of the things I like about it.  Nature is Nature.  Hope it does well.', '2008-12-03 08:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
