(5103639, 744426, 45596, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at.  There''s no straight lines, so the challenge is met.  On the other hand, there''s not many lines at all.  I see the circle lines and some vague curved lines.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at.  There''s no straight lines, so the challenge is met.  On the other hand, there''s not many lines at all.  I see the circle lines and some vague curved lines.', '2008-12-03 21:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103650, 744081, 45596, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Meets the challenge well.  I like the flowing lines in the photo.  A complicated scene to photograph especially with moving water and a stationary rock.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Meets the challenge well.  I like the flowing lines in the photo.  A complicated scene to photograph especially with moving water and a stationary rock.', '2008-12-03 21:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103657, 744026, 45596, '<td valign="top">Yes it is twisted.  Meets the challenge.  A relatively simple shot.  What would happen if you made the shell larger with lighting off to the side?</td>', 'Yes it is twisted.  Meets the challenge.  A relatively simple shot.  What would happen if you made the shell larger with lighting off to the side?', '2008-12-03 21:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
