(5103669, 744106, 45596, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  The tilting seems a little wierd to me.  I wonder if the straight lines will effect your score downward since the challenge is: "Capture an image that includes only curves, twists or other non-straight lines."</td>', 'Interesting photo.  The tilting seems a little wierd to me.  I wonder if the straight lines will effect your score downward since the challenge is: "Capture an image that includes only curves, twists or other non-straight lines."', '2008-12-03 21:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
