(5103735, 743177, 45596, '<td valign="top">Nature has a lot of twisty objects to shoot.  Good photographic eye here.  Nice use of B&amp;W to help bring out the texture of the subject.  Unfortunately, it lacks the "wow" factor IMO, and it''s sort of uninteresting to me.  I cannot suggest anything off the top to improve it.</td>', 'Nature has a lot of twisty objects to shoot.  Good photographic eye here.  Nice use of B&W to help bring out the texture of the subject.  Unfortunately, it lacks the "wow" factor IMO, and it''s sort of uninteresting to me.  I cannot suggest anything off the top to improve it.', '2008-12-03 21:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103736, 743660, 98171, '<td valign="top">While I''m certainly not a prude, and am actually a fan of artistic nudes, I just dont understand why she needed to be nude in this shot? I think it would have looked very nice if she had been wearing maybe a form fitting black shirt or something. Otherwise, I think it''s a nice shot and love the B&amp;W.</td>', 'While I''m certainly not a prude, and am actually a fan of artistic nudes, I just dont understand why she needed to be nude in this shot? I think it would have looked very nice if she had been wearing maybe a form fitting black shirt or something. Otherwise, I think it''s a nice shot and love the B&W.', '2008-12-03 21:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
