(5106464, 742835, 45596, '<td valign="top">The title remains me of the Mill Creek wine I bought recently. :-)  In regards to the photo.  You successfully met the challenge.  I''m thinking that sharper image would help.  It appears to be a cloudy day.  More light from a partly cloudy to a full sunny sky may bring out the colors more.  I like the concept.</td>', 'The title remains me of the Mill Creek wine I bought recently. :-)  In regards to the photo.  You successfully met the challenge.  I''m thinking that sharper image would help.  It appears to be a cloudy day.  More light from a partly cloudy to a full sunny sky may bring out the colors more.  I like the concept.', '2008-12-04 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
