(5106538, 742796, 45596, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  Squids are ugly IMO.  If you in an aquarium or scuba diving, there had to be better subjects I would think.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  Squids are ugly IMO.  If you in an aquarium or scuba diving, there had to be better subjects I would think.', '2008-12-04 17:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
