(5106643, 744103, 45596, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot.  A complicated mix of forks, lighting effects, and smoke.  I like the photo.  It will be interesting to see how the voters will react to so much going on.</td>', 'A very interesting shot.  A complicated mix of forks, lighting effects, and smoke.  I like the photo.  It will be interesting to see how the voters will react to so much going on.', '2008-12-04 18:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106655, 744421, 45596, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Meets the challenge.  I''m not sure about the contrast levels.  The colors seem a little unnatural.  Overall, it still should finish with an above average overall score.</td>', 'Good photo.  Meets the challenge.  I''m not sure about the contrast levels.  The colors seem a little unnatural.  Overall, it still should finish with an above average overall score.', '2008-12-04 18:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
