(5106672, 744163, 45596, '<td valign="top">A good shot dispite some of the straight lines.  DPC trolls can be tough sometimes regarding challenge rules. In this case, "Capture an image that includes <u>only</u> curves, twists or other non-straight lines.  I like your concept.</td>', 'A good shot dispite some of the straight lines.  DPC trolls can be tough sometimes regarding challenge rules. In this case, "Capture an image that includes only curves, twists or other non-straight lines.  I like your concept.', '2008-12-04 18:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
