(5106704, 744392, 45596, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge.  It should do better than most of the other entries.  It has a nice crisp focus, but its too bad bugs have to be so ugly.  Hopefully, the voter will think "neat" and vote high rather than "yuk" and vote low.  Good luck.</td>', 'It meets the challenge.  It should do better than most of the other entries.  It has a nice crisp focus, but its too bad bugs have to be so ugly.  Hopefully, the voter will think "neat" and vote high rather than "yuk" and vote low.  Good luck.', '2008-12-04 18:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106781, 744427, 87808, '<td valign="top">wow those are some soft looking hands.  Good twist</td>', 'wow those are some soft looking hands.  Good twist', '2008-12-04 19:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106782, 743921, 87808, '<td valign="top">wow on the pinks, in your face to say the least, the little red dots break it up nicely, good focus sharp and clear, well done</td>', 'wow on the pinks, in your face to say the least, the little red dots break it up nicely, good focus sharp and clear, well done', '2008-12-04 19:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
