(5106793, 744106, 87808, '<td valign="top">This looks like Westminster, is it? Nice curves, not sure about the angle that you have gone for though. sharp and clean lines</td>', 'This looks like Westminster, is it? Nice curves, not sure about the angle that you have gone for though. sharp and clean lines', '2008-12-04 19:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106794, 744050, 87808, '<td valign="top">ouch big bruise, first thing I noticed after the straws.  I hope she is ok</td>', 'ouch big bruise, first thing I noticed after the straws.  I hope she is ok', '2008-12-04 19:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106830, 744160, 87808, '<td valign="top">Now this is interesting. Vitamin C is derived from Rose Hips and not from the petals of a standard rose.  But you made me question myself adn look it up for confirmation.  So well done on that aspect. Now back to the photo, sharp and clean, gorgeous tones that accent the yellows. nicely sharpened.  well done on all aspects</td>', 'Now this is interesting. Vitamin C is derived from Rose Hips and not from the petals of a standard rose.  But you made me question myself adn look it up for confirmation.  So well done on that aspect. Now back to the photo, sharp and clean, gorgeous tones that accent the yellows. nicely sharpened.  well done on all aspects', '2008-12-04 19:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106842, 742589, 87808, '<td valign="top">rather small in size you should try 640 in size.  My eye is drawn straight to the middle of the shot where it is in focus.</td>', 'rather small in size you should try 640 in size.  My eye is drawn straight to the middle of the shot where it is in focus.', '2008-12-04 19:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5106847, 744044, 87808, '<td valign="top">hmm, lighting a fire to prevent a fire.  Nice twist on the challenge as well.  The eye is drawn to the leading lines of the fire.  the darkness encroaching to the middle gives it flare and drama.</td>', 'hmm, lighting a fire to prevent a fire.  Nice twist on the challenge as well.  The eye is drawn to the leading lines of the fire.  the darkness encroaching to the middle gives it flare and drama.', '2008-12-04 19:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
