(5110290, 742167, 45596, '<td valign="top">Intense use of the blue color is the first thing I noticed here.  Good use of tilting the image for a more dramatic effect.  Good DOF as well.  You take a risk using a tightened up guitar string as the challenge is to avoid straight lines, but I don''t think it will hurt your score much in this case.  Good luck.</td>', 'Intense use of the blue color is the first thing I noticed here.  Good use of tilting the image for a more dramatic effect.  Good DOF as well.  You take a risk using a tightened up guitar string as the challenge is to avoid straight lines, but I don''t think it will hurt your score much in this case.  Good luck.', '2008-12-05 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110291, 744316, 45596, '<td valign="top">I meets the challenge.  I think I would have liked the colored version better.</td>', 'I meets the challenge.  I think I would have liked the colored version better.', '2008-12-05 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110293, 743874, 45596, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a fan of photos with forks as I think it''s over used subject in DPC entries, but this is the exception.  A very clever use of them here.  It easily meets the challenge.  Balancing an egg on them is a bonus.  Great job.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m not usually a fan of photos with forks as I think it''s over used subject in DPC entries, but this is the exception.  A very clever use of them here.  It easily meets the challenge.  Balancing an egg on them is a bonus.  Great job.  Good luck.', '2008-12-05 17:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110297, 744370, 45596, '<td valign="top">It''s an appropriate title.  It meets the challenge, but there''s not much here to comment on.  Just hope that the voters are in a good mood this week.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s an appropriate title.  It meets the challenge, but there''s not much here to comment on.  Just hope that the voters are in a good mood this week.  Good luck.', '2008-12-05 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110302, 744237, 45596, '<td valign="top">The photo has twists and curves, but it also has straight lines.  Some voters may take points away because of this.  The challenge asks you to: "Capture an image that includes <u>only</u> curves, twists or other non-straight lines."  Hopefully, the voting trolls are on vacation this week.</td>', 'The photo has twists and curves, but it also has straight lines.  Some voters may take points away because of this.  The challenge asks you to: "Capture an image that includes only curves, twists or other non-straight lines."  Hopefully, the voting trolls are on vacation this week.', '2008-12-05 17:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110308, 744272, 45596, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The spectrum of colors is what saves this image from being bland.</td>', 'Very nice.  The spectrum of colors is what saves this image from being bland.', '2008-12-05 17:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110311, 743518, 45596, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge.  A good photo overall.</td>', 'It meets the challenge.  A good photo overall.', '2008-12-05 17:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110316, 743105, 45596, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge well.  DPC voters seem to like flower shots.  Good DOF.  I think it will easily place in the top 1/3.  Critique: Why use B&amp;W?  Use the flower''s color(s) to your advantage.  IMO.</td>', 'It meets the challenge well.  DPC voters seem to like flower shots.  Good DOF.  I think it will easily place in the top 1/3.  Critique: Why use B&W?  Use the flower''s color(s) to your advantage.  IMO.', '2008-12-05 17:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110320, 744372, 45596, '<td valign="top">Nature has a lot of twisted things.  You captured the theme very well here.  I like the sharp contrast.</td>', 'Nature has a lot of twisted things.  You captured the theme very well here.  I like the sharp contrast.', '2008-12-05 17:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110324, 742232, 45596, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of straight lines in this image.  This challenge asks you not to use them.  "Capture an image that includes <u>only</u> curves, twists or other non-straight lines."  Hopefully, the voting trolls are forgiving this week.  Good luck.</td>', 'There''s a lot of straight lines in this image.  This challenge asks you not to use them.  "Capture an image that includes only curves, twists or other non-straight lines."  Hopefully, the voting trolls are forgiving this week.  Good luck.', '2008-12-05 18:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110333, 743380, 45596, '<td valign="top">I like the humorus title.  I like the lighting as well.  There are some straight lines in the paint brush handle, but it shouldn''t hurt much in this case.  It will be interesting to see where this photo will place.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the humorus title.  I like the lighting as well.  There are some straight lines in the paint brush handle, but it shouldn''t hurt much in this case.  It will be interesting to see where this photo will place.  Good luck.', '2008-12-05 18:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110336, 743944, 45596, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I like the lighting.  To encourage more photos of this type, I''m giving a 10.</td>', 'I like the concept.  I like the lighting.  To encourage more photos of this type, I''m giving a 10.', '2008-12-05 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110340, 743064, 45596, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Good use of lighting.  Easly meets the challenge.</td>', 'Good photo.  Good use of lighting.  Easly meets the challenge.', '2008-12-05 18:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110341, 744404, 45596, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at.  A sharper focus may help.  The photo definately has potential.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at.  A sharper focus may help.  The photo definately has potential.', '2008-12-05 18:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110344, 744260, 45596, '<td valign="top">The photo meets the challenge.  The title is dramatic.  It''s a good photo in that it is framed well and has a good DOF.  Critique: It''s an average tree.  Yes, it''s growing on rock, but it happens all time.</td>', 'The photo meets the challenge.  The title is dramatic.  It''s a good photo in that it is framed well and has a good DOF.  Critique: It''s an average tree.  Yes, it''s growing on rock, but it happens all time.', '2008-12-05 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110387, 744281, 45596, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge.  I think I would have preferred a closeup of the twisting in the center of the art work.  As is, the image resembles a snapshot of wall art.  Although the wall art is great!</td>', 'It meets the challenge.  I think I would have preferred a closeup of the twisting in the center of the art work.  As is, the image resembles a snapshot of wall art.  Although the wall art is great!', '2008-12-05 18:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110390, 743680, 45596, '<td valign="top">Way cool photo on many levels.  Congrats!</td>', 'Way cool photo on many levels.  Congrats!', '2008-12-05 18:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110394, 743023, 45596, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but that doesn''t matter.  I like the concept and execution of this image.  It meets the challenge well.  The lighting is good and so is the DOF.  A simple yet effective photo.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but that doesn''t matter.  I like the concept and execution of this image.  It meets the challenge well.  The lighting is good and so is the DOF.  A simple yet effective photo.', '2008-12-05 18:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110399, 743946, 45596, '<td valign="top">A very cool photo.  Pun intended.  It''s a tad bit on the busy side for my tastes, but I still like the photo. I especially like the colors.  It has a nice sharp focus and good DOF.  I hope the photo does well.</td>', 'A very cool photo.  Pun intended.  It''s a tad bit on the busy side for my tastes, but I still like the photo. I especially like the colors.  It has a nice sharp focus and good DOF.  I hope the photo does well.', '2008-12-05 18:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110412, 742648, 62895, '<td valign="top">The subject is very twisted, but the lighting is very direct and harsh, and the background is distracting.</td>', 'The subject is very twisted, but the lighting is very direct and harsh, and the background is distracting.', '2008-12-05 18:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110413, 743921, 62895, '<td valign="top">This would make a great product shot! 7</td>', 'This would make a great product shot! 7', '2008-12-05 18:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110416, 742324, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great textures throughout! I like the contrast of colors and textures. It seems a little grainy, and the random gray spots throw me off a little bit. 6</td>', 'Great textures throughout! I like the contrast of colors and textures. It seems a little grainy, and the random gray spots throw me off a little bit. 6', '2008-12-05 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110419, 744295, 62895, '<td valign="top">Very delicate and nice, I like the shadows, the only thing I''m going to pick on is the backdrop, it doesn''t look clean, especially the bottom. 6</td>', 'Very delicate and nice, I like the shadows, the only thing I''m going to pick on is the backdrop, it doesn''t look clean, especially the bottom. 6', '2008-12-05 18:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110422, 744270, 62895, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of exposing white on white, that''s tough.</td>', 'Excellent job of exposing white on white, that''s tough.', '2008-12-05 18:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110425, 742940, 62895, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit of a shoehorn, but I''ll take it. lol. Great colors and dramatic scene.</td>', 'Maybe a bit of a shoehorn, but I''ll take it. lol. Great colors and dramatic scene.', '2008-12-05 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110428, 742213, 62895, '<td valign="top">So simplistic, and very effective. The curves are mesmerizing.</td>', 'So simplistic, and very effective. The curves are mesmerizing.', '2008-12-05 19:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110432, 744229, 62895, '<td valign="top">Creepy, nice double exposure! Only a few telltale blur marks.</td>', 'Creepy, nice double exposure! Only a few telltale blur marks.', '2008-12-05 19:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110437, 744164, 62895, '<td valign="top">Great stuff! Excellent choice of subject, fantastic lighting, and stunning image.</td>', 'Great stuff! Excellent choice of subject, fantastic lighting, and stunning image.', '2008-12-05 19:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110516, 744069, 45596, '<td valign="top">A simple but effective photo for this challenge, but sometimes a photo can be too simple.  This might be one of them IMO.  Let''s hope that the voting trolls show mercy this week.  Good luck.</td>', 'A simple but effective photo for this challenge, but sometimes a photo can be too simple.  This might be one of them IMO.  Let''s hope that the voting trolls show mercy this week.  Good luck.', '2008-12-05 19:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
