(5110666, 744295, 45596, '<td valign="top">I like the photo.  I might have used a black background.  I see that the shadows are twisting, but it doesn''t add that much IMO.  In addition, the focus could be a tad bit sharper.</td>', 'I like the photo.  I might have used a black background.  I see that the shadows are twisting, but it doesn''t add that much IMO.  In addition, the focus could be a tad bit sharper.', '2008-12-05 20:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
