(5110690, 744388, 67841, '<td valign="top">What a handsome dude (or pretty lady?) - I thought of curled bamboo for this challenge but didn''t have anything even close to being this cute to augment it! I love how some frogs just look like they''re smiling...  Good luck! -- 8 --</td>', 'What a handsome dude (or pretty lady?) - I thought of curled bamboo for this challenge but didn''t have anything even close to being this cute to augment it! I love how some frogs just look like they''re smiling...  Good luck! -- 8 --', '2008-12-05 20:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
