(5121327, 744033, 76430, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on getting 6th place on your first entry!  I dream of getting 6th place sometime in my first 100 entries!  And for not knowing much about cameras you have a great eye and instincts for the right picture.  Keep it up.  Great capture.</td>', 'Congratulations on getting 6th place on your first entry!  I dream of getting 6th place sometime in my first 100 entries!  And for not knowing much about cameras you have a great eye and instincts for the right picture.  Keep it up.  Great capture.', '2008-12-10 01:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
