(5121443, 743141, 72136, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for commenting. <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I could not delete the lines on the pavement... :(<br/> <br/>Also, I did not use any texture, this is really the texture of the pavement. I just cropped the picture of the kitty that was literally posing there and turned it to b&amp;w. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for commenting.  Unfortunately, I could not delete the lines on the pavement... :( Also, I did not use any texture, this is really the texture of the pavement. I just cropped the picture of the kitty that was literally posing there and turned it to b&w.  ', '2008-12-10 02:53:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5121448, 744388, 49109, '<td valign="top">Keep them frogs coming! Congrats on your well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Keep them frogs coming! Congrats on your well deserved ribbon!', '2008-12-10 02:55:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5121454, 744164, 49109, '<td valign="top">Congrats Irene! The stuff <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=25355" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Pug-H</a> wrote about is "PRITT glue-it", works very well (use the "repositionable" sort)</td>', 'Congrats Irene! The stuff  Pug-H wrote about is "PRITT glue-it", works very well (use the "repositionable" sort)', '2008-12-10 02:57:58.000000', NULL, 0),
