(5131592, 743243, 62357, '<td valign="top"><b>From the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>Seems to me this shot was one of those that didn''t immediately jump out to the speed voters.  This is a pity as I think overall it is a good photo.  It surely meets the challenge and the composition is great.  Another possible reason for the lower score is the subject does lack a bit of the DPC wow factor.......<br/> <br/>It looks to me that is slightly soft, I am not sure if this is because it was cropped or if it''s a product of the slow shutter speed &amp; high ISO combination.  I may have reduced the aperture to get a slightly faster shutter speed, which should have minimised the possible camera shake.  <br/> <br/>I am sorry this did not score higher, I think it is a strong image for this challenge, but the score is suffering due to some technical issues.</td>', 'From the Critique Club  Seems to me this shot was one of those that didn''t immediately jump out to the speed voters.  This is a pity as I think overall it is a good photo.  It surely meets the challenge and the composition is great.  Another possible reason for the lower score is the subject does lack a bit of the DPC wow factor....... It looks to me that is slightly soft, I am not sure if this is because it was cropped or if it''s a product of the slow shutter speed & high ISO combination.  I may have reduced the aperture to get a slightly faster shutter speed, which should have minimised the possible camera shake.   I am sorry this did not score higher, I think it is a strong image for this challenge, but the score is suffering due to some technical issues.', '2008-12-15 05:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
